# chatPlayerWin(Player player)
# Fires when the human checkmates the engine — the "ok I'm actually
# an AI" reveal. Triggered from interactEntity at the first
# checkGameOver call, gated on isCheckmate AND sideToMove !=
# playerColor (which together identify a checkmate against the
# engine, not against the human).
#
# Each @delay between lines is a "typing pause" so the messages
# trickle in the way a real player's chat would. The leading 80-tick
# delay lets the checkmate beat land first (player sees the move,
# then the bot starts revealing itself a few seconds later).
#
# Body is a TEST PLACEHOLDER — replace with the real reveal
# wording / pick from a flavor pool. Keep the (player) signature so
# the trigger stays unchanged.

@using rychess
@fast

@delay 40
@player &aRYgamer1&7 -> You: ayyy gg
@delay 45
@player &aRYgamer1&7 -> You: ill open the gate for you
@delay 60
@player &aRYgamer1&7 -> You: btw this &lisnt actually RYgamer1.
@delay 60
@player &aRYgamer1&7 -> You: &aI made a chess engine with Minr Scripts! 
@bypass /playsound minecraft:entity.chicken.egg master @s ~ ~ ~ 0.5 0.8
@delay 55
@player &aRYgamer1&7 -> You: &aAnd simulated myself playing using teleport commands!
@bypass /playsound minecraft:entity.chicken.egg master @s ~ ~ ~ 0.5 0.9
@delay 50
@player &aRYgamer1&7 -> You: &aDont spoil it for anyone else!
@bypass /playsound minecraft:entity.chicken.egg master @s ~ ~ ~ 0.5 1.0
@delay 50
@player &aRYgamer1&7 -> You: &aI hope I fooled you! &b&kk&b&lGG&b&kk
@bypass /playsound minecraft:entity.chicken.egg master @s ~ ~ ~ 0.5 1.2
@delay 60
@player &7(The gate is now open)


@bypass /fill -9134 -61 9660 -9133 -60 9660 air
@bypass /fill -9135 -61 9659 -9132 -56 9659 air replace barrier strict